; Imports the verified mesh via the proven working route (raw TUI, same as
; import_mesh.jou) and saves it as a plain case file, so PyFluent can load
; an ordinary .cas file instead of re-triggering the CGNS reader crash seen
; when importing CGNS through PyFluent's settings API (SIGSEGV in
; CeetronSAM.dll specifically on that code path).

/file/import/cgns/mesh
regime0_capsule.cgns

; Set axisymmetric BEFORE saving: a later PyFluent attempt to switch
; two_dim_space on an already-loaded (planar-saved) case caused an
; immediate iteration-1 divergence (x/y-momentum and pressure all
; blowing up at the very first solve), independent of timestep size --
; consistent with stale planar-computed cell-volume/geometry metrics
; being reused under an axisymmetric interpretation. Baking this in at
; mesh-creation time instead.
/define/models/axisymmetric yes

/file/write-case "regime0_mesh_only.cas.h5"
exit
yes
